<p style='color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>{{#if firstName}}Hello {{firstName}},{{else}}Hello,{{/if}}</p>
<h2 style='color:#1a1a1a;margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:20px;'>{{#if cannotMeet}}Departure Cannot Be Met{{else}}Departure at Risk{{/if}}</h2>
<p style='color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>{{vehicleName}}{{#if licensePlate}} ({{licensePlate}}){{/if}} departs from {{siteName}} at {{departureAt}} and {{#if cannotMeet}}cannot reach{{else}}may not reach{{/if}} its charging target in time{{#if shortfallKwh}}: {{shortfallKwh}} kWh short{{/if}}.{{#if reasonSiteCapacity}} The site does not have enough power for every vehicle.{{else if reasonNotPluggedIn}} The vehicle is not plugged in yet.{{else if reasonLateArrival}} The vehicle plugged in too late to charge fully.{{else if reasonChargerNotFollowing}} The charger draws more power than its plan allows.{{else if reasonProfileRejected}} The charger refused its charging plan.{{else if reasonStationOffline}} The charger is offline.{{else if reasonVehiclePower}} The vehicle accepts less power than it needs.{{else if reasonUnknownSoc}} The vehicle's state of charge is unknown, so the plan assumes it arrived empty.{{/if}}</p>
